# Generated / runtime artifacts — never committed. The committed state is the
# pipeline DEFINITION only; datasets, indexes, predictions, metrics and the
# dvc.lock are (re)produced by `make`/`dvc repro`, which require the cluster.
datasets/*.json
runs/
results/
metrics/
wcss/logs/
wcss/fleet_paths.env
.env
dvc.lock
__pycache__/
*.pyc
